<title>USA: T/SF Communications Q4 net slips.</title>
<headline>T/SF Communications Q4 net slips.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>T/SF COMMUNICATIONS CORPORATION</p>
<p>			   (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					 Three Months Ended  Year Ended</p>
<p>					    December 31,  December 31,</p>
<p>					    (unaudited)     (audited)</p>
<p>					  1996     1995    1996    1995</p>
<p>Revenues			     23,537  17,740  68,642  72,078</p>
<p>Costs and expenses:		19,026  15,587  60,120  55,966</p>
<p>Income from continuing</p>
<p>  operations			  2,988   4,296   5,421  15,788</p>
<p>FOOTNOTES:</p>
<p>In 1995, T/SF had net income of $15,825,000, or $4.20 per share, including a non-recurring, $11,739,000 pre-tax gain from the August 1995 sale of three trade publications.</p>
<p>For the three months ended December 31, 1996, revenues rose 33% to $23,537,000, compared to revenues of $17,740,000, in the comparable 1995 period, and 1996 pre-tax income more than doubled versus the prior year.</p>
</text>
